    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806370/extras/3ac3d7af163a1880745df20c965b7289.poster.avif?t=1752928290\" width=400 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806370/extras/3ac3d7af163a1880745df20c965b7289.webm?t=1752928290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806370/extras/3ac3d7af163a1880745df20c965b7289.mp4?t=1752928290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive isolation and earn $1,000,000.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features of the game:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in a closed room. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hour you get $1000. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can leave without money at any time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you collect 1 million dollars, you can take them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main thing is not to go crazy. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain your mental health.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Money can be used to purchase goods in the store, but prices are increased 100 times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0421reate items that will help you survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful in the room besides you there is someone else. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806370/extras/3d6fd9331c8ac857cb51f51d36361f82.poster.avif?t=1752928290\" width=400 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806370/extras/3d6fd9331c8ac857cb51f51d36361f82.webm?t=1752928290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806370/extras/3d6fd9331c8ac857cb51f51d36361f82.mp4?t=1752928290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806370/extras/3ac3d7af163a1880745df20c965b7289.poster.avif?t=1752928290\" width=400 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806370/extras/3ac3d7af163a1880745df20c965b7289.webm?t=1752928290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806370/extras/3ac3d7af163a1880745df20c965b7289.mp4?t=1752928290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive isolation and earn $1,000,000.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features of the game:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in a closed room. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hour you get $1000. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can leave without money at any time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you collect 1 million dollars, you can take them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main thing is not to go crazy. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain your mental health.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Money can be used to purchase goods in the store, but prices are increased 100 times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0421reate items that will help you survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful in the room besides you there is someone else. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806370/extras/3d6fd9331c8ac857cb51f51d36361f82.poster.avif?t=1752928290\" width=400 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806370/extras/3d6fd9331c8ac857cb51f51d36361f82.webm?t=1752928290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806370/extras/3d6fd9331c8ac857cb51f51d36361f82.mp4?t=1752928290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
